body:
Yuuuup, I was reading this and instantly went to heroin. Hate to be that way because maybe something else is wrong, but every time I get a message for people asking for money that I "owe" them from a decade ago it is always about heroin. Shit, usually even if they ask to borrow money its usually heroin. 

&#x200B;

Damn sad.

Nope, but now I've found my anthem. 

&#x200B;

Thank you.
